{"strongs": "H8588", "word": "תַּעֲנוּג", "translit": "ta.a.nug", "root": "ענב", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "daintiness, luxury, exquisite delight", "definition": "תַּעֲנוּג noun [masculine] daintiness, luxury, exquisite delight ; — 1. luxury: ׳ ת Prov 19:10 elsewhere plural; construct תַּעֲנֻגוֺת Eccl 2:8 . 2. suffix בְּנֵי תַּעֲנוּנָ֑יִךְ Mic 1:16 thy dainty sons ; בֵּית תַּעֲנֻגֶיהָ Mic 2:9 her (their) dainty house(s) , > of tender love (reading בְּנֵי Mic 2:9 We Now . 3. delight of love, plural absolute בַּתַּעֲנוּגִים Song 7:7 ( Perles Anal. 22 f. conjecture בַּת עַמִּינָדָב ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6192')\">BDB6192</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8588')\">H8588</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6191')\">BDB6191</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6193')\">BDB6193</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תַּעֲנוּג</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>daintiness, luxury, exquisite delight</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>luxury:</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 19:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,10)\">Prov 19:10</ref> elsewhere plural; construct <bdbheb>תַּעֲנֻגוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:8\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,8)\">Eccl 2:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> suffix <bdbheb>בְּנֵי תַּעֲנוּנָ֑יִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 1:16\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(33,1,16)\">Mic 1:16</ref> <highlight>thy dainty sons</highlight>; <bdbheb>בֵּית תַּעֲנֻגֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 2:9\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(33,2,9)\">Mic 2:9</ref> <highlight>her</highlight> (their) <highlight>dainty house(s)</highlight>, &gt; of tender love (reading <bdbheb>בְּנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 2:9\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" v